WEBVTT

00:01:27.596 --> 00:01:31.076
As friends tried to rescue their homes,

00:01:31.116 --> 00:01:33.196
poised on tin roofs,

00:01:33.236 --> 00:01:39.436
armed with hoses until the smoke
and embers clung to their clothes.

00:01:42.236 --> 00:01:44.076
I felt despair.

00:01:44.836 --> 00:01:45.956
Grief.

00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:47.876
Frustration.

00:01:48.676 --> 00:01:49.796
Fury.

00:01:50.716 --> 00:01:53.276
And staring at that wall of fire

00:01:53.316 --> 00:01:58.876
higher and more ferocious
than any I'd seen before,

00:01:58.916 --> 00:02:01.276
I felt helpless,